&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OqGZdUPi6oJlXzxlmNiu3gAmsVg&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;OKX will be prioritising applicants who have a current right to work in Singapore, and do not require OKX&#39;s sponsorship of a visa.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxuslsyQOGHoiYb47TiA1n51Th&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxustOiFVk8C3Uy4rotl5Nem5f&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q479dQIlZozY6cxcPNFuoY1rsxe&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKOAdw3kVoh5EQxcr2juP3i0sTb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusq2WnfR822THsuqUosdSzFu&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus9qcafz8J9vhi3nwZgrckWg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AiPQdXfdFoecDex1OG7lJgYoghb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VhAAd9EtnoP9uDxtiUZlBDKCg3b&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AiPQdXfdFoecDex1OG7lJgYoghb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Stlld0WVVoPsKLxjNoslHDN0gfO&quot;&gt;As a Technical Expert, you will own the core build-out of the Operations Automation &amp;amp; Cloud Management Platform, focusing on the &lt;strong&gt;unified management and intelligent orchestration of multi-cloud products&lt;/strong&gt;. By integrating with cloud provider APIs (Aliyun, AWS, Azure), the role builds full-lifecycle management capabilities across compute, storage, network, database, and middleware resources—combined with CMDB, Event Center, orchestration engines, and AI / LLM capabilities—to evolve from manual operations toward intelligent control and automated change, continuously improving operational efficiency and stability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VhAAd9EtnoP9uDxtiUZlBDKCg3b&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxushHxPgvpIV0pJrijghkWDWe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AiPQdXfdFoecDex1OG7lJgYoghb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBtVdcSiCo1mCTx1ZLSlLJ0agKe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design and develop the Operations Automation &amp;amp; Cloud Management Platform, building &lt;strong&gt;full-lifecycle management capabilities for multi-cloud resources&lt;/strong&gt; across compute, storage, network, database, and middleware;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W1wDd4pK2oImWYxicQplfdvXgke&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrate with cloud provider APIs (Aliyun, AWS, Azure) and Terraform&lt;/strong&gt; to enable unified onboarding, automated provisioning, configuration changes, and cost optimization of cloud products;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qhb5dtZDsoNsl8xx0rPlmml7gOc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the design and development of core systems including &lt;strong&gt;CMDB, Event Center, and orchestration engines&lt;/strong&gt;, building a unified data foundation for resources, configurations, and events, and develop workflow engines, task schedulers, and approval mechanisms;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4RCdLBVvoCC3KxIgVbl2CP8gTb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build &lt;strong&gt;intelligent cloud management capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;, leveraging AI / LLM for intelligent orchestration, change-risk assessment, and capacity/cost prediction, driving the evolution from manual operations to intelligent control;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ay57dJINtoB4CUxUDj0lZKYHglg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Explore the application of &lt;strong&gt;AI / LLM in cloud management&lt;/strong&gt;, building an intelligent ops assistant (ChatOps / AI Copilot) to support natural-language-driven cloud resource operations and smart ticket handling;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DjfmdWcdFo0HQLxRdiSluHLFgbb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design and maintain unified RESTful / gRPC interfaces and SDKs, and participate in platform security (OIDC, IAM Role, RBAC, audit) and operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusWnZPeJsdMU53QGew90VQeh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AiPQdXfdFoecDex1OG7lJgYoghb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mr2UdRpM8o3lUhxsQjAl0xHvgNe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or above in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or related fields;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RiqTdGp84oV1qGxsDp8lnjhpgKg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proficient in &lt;strong&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt;, familiar with Spring / Spring Boot / Spring Cloud;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DtUUdbw7AoyJ7Lx3aTFljtoPgMZ&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development or integration experience in multi-cloud resource management (Aliyun, AWS, Azure) and cloud provider APIs / Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U5s7diAjFoYmijxZq02lW76LgAf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong API design and system integration skills, with understanding of distributed architecture;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F0wUdpuQaoaVAqx0ZdflzpTBgQb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience designing or developing CMDB, orchestration engines, or event centers;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FJ63dckIsod68IxESzTlQ77WgBc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Knowledge of AI / LLM application development (Prompt Engineering, RAG, Agent), able to integrate AI into cloud management and operations scenarios;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hd8UdaNxuoI4QjxzvXFlRB6Fgog&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and strong code-quality awareness.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gb04dtjtMoHmldxfAjXuI6P4snC&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Competitive total compensation package&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gb04dtjtMoHmldxfAjXuI6P4snC&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;L&amp;amp;D programs and education subsidy for employees&#39; growth and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusfCPfNQIPMLDddcFHLcCJRC&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Various team building programs and company events&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusfCPfNQIPMLDddcFHLcCJRC&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Wellness and meal allowances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusfCPfNQIPMLDddcFHLcCJRC&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Comprehensive healthcare schemes for employees and dependants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusfCPfNQIPMLDddcFHLcCJRC&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;More that we love to tell you along the process!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
