descriptions.job-00649q5:
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusma6Bx2pAKat1zHWb20RZWf&quot;&gt;OKX will be prioritising applicants who have a current right to work in Singapore, and do not require OKX&#39;s sponsorship of a visa.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuswk2OUbpdSGWlz2cCcs5CSc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusUyVxJ9vi0TpveaxQY7q4yb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuscKHt3azhyYB9xqYQl3wzwd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;RpoEdRXrWoavx2xJ5CPu6mmysBc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y9usd0Vc5oLuEZxvabeuEyXOsih&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HHmBdlFmyo2NyWxdbhGuQ9Zosid&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;RpoEdRXrWoavx2xJ5CPu6mmysBc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKOAdw3kVoh5EQxcr2juP3i0sTb&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: We Before Me, Do the Right Thing, and Get Things Done. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusfTbk0vxn7Qk6JHVsLUmEEb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusHGEqEW92PZKH3uD5DtRReb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusSam8JYjnJdAHXjIT9bjE7b&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Total Rewards mastermind to lead the design and enhancement of our global Total Rewards strategy. In this exciting new role, you will lead a talented global team in shaping the future of our compensation policies. You will be driving the implementation of both short-term and long-term incentive plans, collaborating closely with senior leadership and HR teams to resolve compensation and benefits challenges. Your expertise will guide benchmarking studies, optimize annual compensation processes, and continuously improve our rewards approach.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusGGzZ6DYqM1WkMH3DhQREWd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusn50rE8oBELU0uyk4JuEsLf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DOeOdLXxdo3ljQxGoaOu5ZYfsN5&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design and build up C&amp;amp;B policies and guidelines that ensure competitive pay positioning, including but not limited to global compensation structure, global benefits programs and tailored compensation tools.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V0XsdEE9Pof775xhEGMux3Mtsvb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive the design and implementation of company-wide short-term and long-term incentive programs. Serve as the focal point with business functions, crafting and executing communication strategies that secure stakeholder buy-in and support.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RxB8dk5YEousZMxE0JbuiMT0sNf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Advocate for and influencing senior management on new Total Rewards strategies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U0IDdkEQBokPcWxtfoKuGnI2shb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Effectively partner with the business, HRBPs and other HR functions to manage, consult on, and resolve complex compensation and benefits matters.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEgbdwqAqo3MlhxtFW8uLlvPszg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the team in conducting benchmarking studies to analyze and evaluate the effectiveness of current policies and guidelines, identifying gaps and recommending areas for enhancement.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FMfgd3P2GoKwWwxfSG5ut1kpswd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Oversee the execution of annual C&amp;amp;B programs, including the annual salary review, Long-Term Incentive (LTI) grants, benefits reviews, salary surveys, etc.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y6UjdH2aUonMwrxzcp1u4sbNswb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Guide the team in delivering training to HR staff and business leaders on processes and best practices within the Total Rewards framework, ensuring direct interaction with employees at all levels.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TXW9dCzlyoNDFfxxJrZur0lPs8b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive the design and improvement of workflows and procedures to maximize efficiency, managing programs from a project management perspective. Manage short to long-term planning, policy and program development, and recommend new approaches to support continuous improvement.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OEQqdZDyeokAbExkAaXuu3H0sxb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusEP8lmxTmW3DcbpdMJqmBKd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
